        "detailed_description": "<h1>Create Your Own Bit Buddy</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>Special Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/2ffdeac995fa5cd23a85ce9486400393.avif?t=1788200612\" width=1414 height=464 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.poster.avif?t=1788200612\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.webm?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.mp4?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bit Buddy</strong> reacts in real-time to your keyboard and mouse activity. Every click and movement brings an adorable response from your little companion. Even better, each interaction gives you a chance to unlock new decorations, with no extra effort required!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>600+ unique accessories and pet skins</strong> to collect and customize, you can give your Bit Buddy a one-of-a-kind look that matches your style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Buddy automatically logs your daily and historical keyboard and mouse activity, so you can easily track how much you’ve typed or clicked.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're working or studying, <strong>Bit Buddy</strong> stays by your side on your screen—your loyal digital coworker, always there with you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💻 Instantly responds to your mouse and keyboard actions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/0479fa134156a4093b835405f0a75fdd.poster.avif?t=1788200612\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/0479fa134156a4093b835405f0a75fdd.webm?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/0479fa134156a4093b835405f0a75fdd.mp4?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎤 Reacts to your microphone input in real time:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/49265092c7445f9ebdcbbb533ad8b163.poster.avif?t=1788200612\" width=776 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/49265092c7445f9ebdcbbb533ad8b163.webm?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/49265092c7445f9ebdcbbb533ad8b163.mp4?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎁 Each use of your keyboard or mouse may reward you with decorations, no extra steps needed!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/ead63c650eb372a28aeae666f8e6628a.poster.avif?t=1788200612\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/ead63c650eb372a28aeae666f8e6628a.webm?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/ead63c650eb372a28aeae666f8e6628a.mp4?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally, want to see your character in <strong>Bit Buddy</strong>? Join our Discord and let’s make it happen together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Privacy Policy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Buddy does not collect any of your device or personal information.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any keyboard or mouse usage data is stored locally on your own device and is never uploaded anywhere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other than the required communication with Steam (for things like purchase verification, achievements, or cloud save), the game does not perform any other network communication.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.poster.avif?t=1788200612\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.webm?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.mp4?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bit Buddy</strong> reacts in real-time to your keyboard and mouse activity. Every click and movement brings an adorable response from your little companion. Even better, each interaction gives you a chance to unlock new decorations, with no extra effort required!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>600+ unique accessories and pet skins</strong> to collect and customize, you can give your Bit Buddy a one-of-a-kind look that matches your style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Buddy automatically logs your daily and historical keyboard and mouse activity, so you can easily track how much you’ve typed or clicked.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're working or studying, <strong>Bit Buddy</strong> stays by your side on your screen—your loyal digital coworker, always there with you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💻 Instantly responds to your mouse and keyboard actions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/0479fa134156a4093b835405f0a75fdd.poster.avif?t=1788200612\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/0479fa134156a4093b835405f0a75fdd.webm?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/0479fa134156a4093b835405f0a75fdd.mp4?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎤 Reacts to your microphone input in real time:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/49265092c7445f9ebdcbbb533ad8b163.poster.avif?t=1788200612\" width=776 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/49265092c7445f9ebdcbbb533ad8b163.webm?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/49265092c7445f9ebdcbbb533ad8b163.mp4?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎁 Each use of your keyboard or mouse may reward you with decorations, no extra steps needed!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/ead63c650eb372a28aeae666f8e6628a.poster.avif?t=1788200612\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/ead63c650eb372a28aeae666f8e6628a.webm?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/ead63c650eb372a28aeae666f8e6628a.mp4?t=1788200612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally, want to see your character in <strong>Bit Buddy</strong>? Join our Discord and let’s make it happen together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Privacy Policy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Buddy does not collect any of your device or personal information.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any keyboard or mouse usage data is stored locally on your own device and is never uploaded anywhere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other than the required communication with Steam (for things like purchase verification, achievements, or cloud save), the game does not perform any other network communication.</p></li></ul>",
